SUMMARY:S.O.F.I.A. Welcomes the Community to its 16th Annual Walk Against Domestic Violence
DESCRIPTION:On Saturday\, September 19\, 2026\, Start Out Fresh Intervention Advocates (S.O.F.I.A.) invites the community to affirm that “With Awareness There is Hope” at its 16th Annual Walk Against Domestic Violence in beautiful Canterbury Park. Registration for the Walk begins at 9 AM\, the program begins at 10 AM\, and the event ends at Noon. \nS.O.F.I.A. is thrilled to welcome Dr. Zakiyyah Green as Grand Marshal for our 16th Annual Walk Against Domestic Violence. Dr. Green is a longtime volunteer and advocate with S.O.F.I.A. As Executive director of W.I.S.E. and CEO of Ministry Without Walls\, LLC\, Dr. Green blends biblical wisdom with practical life strategies. A Certified Domestic Violence Advocate\, Dr. Green’s message inspires healing\, restoration\, and resilience\, encouraging all to overcome adversity and live transformed lives. \nJoining S.O.F.I.A.’s 16th Annual Walk Against Domestic Violence on September 19\, 2026 means showing support through action and intent. S.O.F.I.A. holds its annual Walk Against Domestic Violence to show those affected by domestic violence\, especially those still in abusive relationships\, that they are not alone and that they have a network of support to hold them up. Joining us helps reduce the stigma and isolation of domestic violence. \n9:00 a.m. – 10:00 a.m.: Registration\, snacks\, and raffles\n10:00 a.m. – 11:00 a.m.: Warm up and walk at your own pace!\n11:15 a.m. – 11:45 a.m.: Grand Marshal – Dr. Zakiyyah Green and Recognitions\n12:00 p.m. – Closing Meditation with the Community \nRegistration for individuals starts at $20. Team Captains can pre-register for $45 and have team members sign up for $20 each. Teams can choose to represent a business\, organization\, or community group – a great way to highlight community involvement and values. We hope you’ll join us! See information here: http://supportsofia.org/events/ \nThanks to a generous donation from EasyOptOuts.com\, ALL who pre-register as a Team Captain and the first 20 individual registrants will receive a FREE year of membership to Easy Opt Outs\, a privacy protection service. \nThose unable to join the event can walk virtually via social media posts and live broadcasts or make a donation directly to S.O.F.I.A. in honor or remembrance of a loved one via PayPal here: http://supportsofia.org/donate/\, or send a check to S.O.F.I.A.\, PO Box 674\, Montclair\, NJ 07042. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/s-o-f-i-a-welcomes-the-community-to-its-16th-annual-walk-against-domestic-violence/
LOCATION:Canterbury Park\, Montclair\, 07042\, United States Minor Outlying Islands
CATEGORIES:General Events
