SUMMARY:Book Signing Event with Linda Perillo\, Author of Your Payment Method Has Been Declined
DESCRIPTION:Linda Perillo\, local author\, radio host and family travel expert based in Madison\, NJ is hitting the road and stopping at several New Jersey bookstores to sign copies of her memoir\, Your Payment Method Has Been Declined (and other shocking things about me). As a mother of eight and daughter of Mario Perillo\, founder of Perillo Tours\, America’s leader in Italian travel since 1945\, Linda brings a no-nonsense approach when it comes to family\, finance\, and travel. \nThough born into a life surrounded by opportunity\, Linda’s journey has been defined as much by hardship as privilege. Your Payment Method Has Been Declined offers a candid account of her life-defining moments—from the grief encompassing divorce to the loss of her parents\, her brother\, and her freedom through the shackles of a trust left by her father—and how they taught her the true meaning of resilience\, empathy and\, as her father taught her from a young age\, to always have a Plan B. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/book-signing-event-with-linda-perillo-author-of-your-payment-method-has-been-declined-2/
LOCATION:Barnes & Noble Woodland Park\, 1156 Route 46 West\, Woodland Park\, 07424\, United States
CATEGORIES:Literature
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-07-15-at-10.09.48-AM.png
