SUMMARY:Book Signing Event with Linda Perillo\, Author of Your Payment Method Has Been Declined
DESCRIPTION:Author Linda Perillo—daughter of the late Mario Perillo\, CEO & Founder of Perillo Tours\, radio host\, mother of eight\, and travel expert— is continuing her New Jersey book tour with a stop on Saturday\, September 19th\, from 1-4pm at Barnes & Noble Woodland Park\, where she will be signing copies of her autobiography\, Your Payment Method Has Been Declined (and other shocking things about me). \nDespite spending much of her childhood traveling the world\, growing up in Saddle River\, NJ\, as the youngest of four taught Linda that there is truly no place like home. That revelation inspired her to share her deeply personal memoir with the community that shaped her. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
