SUMMARY:Autumn Equinox Mini Retreat at Van Vleck
DESCRIPTION:Saturday September 19\, 1:30 PM – 4:00 PM (rain date: Sunday September 20th) \nJoin Jodi Brooks and Jennifer Hondru for an afternoon of yoga\, meditation\, and mindfulness while connecting with nature in the beautiful Van Vleck gardens. Together we will blend mindful movement and constructive rest with breath and meditation to embrace and welcome the seasonal shift into fall. This mini-retreat will include… \n~ Intention setting for the season ahead \n~ A Yoga practice to build strength & balance\, cultivate calm & cool\, and allow self care with rest & relaxation \n~ Guided movement\, breathing practices\, and meditation \n~ A mindful walk through the magnificent Van Vleck gardens \n~ Light refreshment \n~ An opportunity for meaningful connection with others. \nPlease bring a mat\, and an open mind and heart.\nFee: $50 Members; $65 General Public. Registration required \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
