SUMMARY:Supper & Soulful Sounds in North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:NORTH JERSEY\, A DIFFERENT KIND OF DINNER & SHOW IS COMING YOUR WAY! \nFor people who crave something beyond the usual dinner-and-drinks routine\, step into the candlelit world of Supper & Soulful Sounds\, a Harlem Renaissance-inspired evening of music\, laughter\, connection\, Caribbean flavors\, and vintage glamour. \nYour evening begins with a complimentary rum punch\, followed by a delicious Caribbean-American buffet dinner featuring Jerk Chicken Wings\, Sweet Thai Chili Salmon\, Rasta Pasta\, Jamaican Rice & Peas\, and more. \nThen\, settle in for the Music & Comedy of Acute Inflections. This couple from NYC has entertained more than 50\,000 guests across the U.S. and abroad at their sold-out shows. Their unique sound blends the timeless elegance of Billie Holiday with the soulful spirit of Erykah Badu\, creating an experience that feels both classic and refreshingly original. \nWhether you arrive in Gatsby-inspired glamour or your own personal style\, you’ll be surrounded by people who appreciate soulful vibes\, meaningful moments\, and a chance to step outside the ordinary. \nAs seen on HBO and Amazon\, and backed by more than 1\,000 five-star reviews\, Soulful Sounds has become a favorite among audiences who believe a night out should feel special. \nAnd because a special night out should feel effortless from the moment you arrive\, complimentary valet parking is included for our guests. \nLocated in Hillside\, just minutes from Newark\, Virgo’s Paradise Restaurant is a stylish Black-owned Caribbean-American restaurant pairing bold island flavors with modern American influences in an inviting setting made for dining\, celebration\, and memorable nights out. \nTickets are selling quickly for this intimate one-night-only dinner experience on Saturday\, September 19th. Your buffet dinner\, welcome rum punch\, live show\, and valet parking are all included\, so reserve your seats and join us for an unforgettable evening! \nPlanning a birthday celebration\, church outing\, or night out with friends? Groups of 8+ enjoy a healthy discount! Just call us at 212.729.8372 before you purchase\, and we’ll hook you up. \n* Your purchase helps support the Renaissance Youth Center\, a South Bronx-based charity that empowers inner-city youth through music education\, after-school programs\, and tutoring. * \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/supper-soulful-sounds-in-north-jersey/
LOCATION:Virgo’s Paradise\, 1398 Liberty Ave\, Hillside\, NJ\, 07205\, United States
CATEGORIES:Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/unnamed-38-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="Acute Inflections":MAILTO:info@acuteinflections.com
END:VEVENT
