SUMMARY:Maplewood’s Bob Miller Oysterfest Celebrates America’s 250th with “Stars\, Stripes and Shells”
DESCRIPTION:A Maplewood tradition returns Sept. 19 with annual fundraiser and outdoor community event supporting melanoma research and local families in need. \nJoin the Robert J. Miller Foundation and the Township of Maplewood for the annual Oysterfest\, a community event and fundraiser supporting melanoma awareness\, the Melanoma Research Foundation\, and local MAPSO families in need. \nThis year’s “Stars\, Stripes & Shells” celebration honors America’s 250th anniversary with an evening featuring live music\, an open bar\, bagpipers\, catering by Celebrated Foods\, and Oysterfest’s popular raw oyster bar. \nSaturday\, September 19\, 2026 | 6–10 PM\nThe Woodland | 60 Woodland Road\, Maplewood\, NJ \nAdults only. Since 2015\, thousands of local residents have come together at Oysterfest to enjoy an evening of community\, food\, and entertainment while helping raise vital funds for melanoma research and families in need. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/maplewoods-bob-miller-oysterfest-celebrates-americas-250th-with-stars-stripes-and-shells/
LOCATION:The Woodland\, 60 Woodland Road\, Maplewood\, NJ\, 07040\, United States
CATEGORIES:Food
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/RJMiller-Oysterfest-2026.png
