SUMMARY:Claire Wellin\, Presented by Fletcher’s Listening Room
DESCRIPTION:Claire Wellin\, a NY based artist brings her powerful music to Montclair. Lauded by producer Nick Crane\, “Claire is a virtuoso talent and complete professional\, but what makes her truly special is her uncanny ability to breathe deep emotional resonance into her performances – it’s truly special. She’s a gem.” The show happens in an intimate venue. BYO. Doors at 7:30pm\, Show begins at 8pm. Register at uumontclair.org/events\, or use the QR Code on the flyer. 67 Church Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
