SUMMARY:Outdoor Art Party
DESCRIPTION:Outdoor Art Party \nBrowse 40 artists with all art under $300\, then shop your way through South Orange with sidewalk sales\, special offers\, pop-ups\, and great finds from local businesses. The Outdoor Art Party & Shopping Crawl comes to downtown on Sunday\, September 20 from 10 AM – 4 PM where art meets local shopping. \nPlus\, enjoy music\, food\, drinks\, and hands-on art activities throughout the day. Come ready to browse\, shop\, create\, and discover something new!⁠ Don’t miss all the excitement happening in Spiotta Park\, 20-32 Village Plaza and throughout South Orange\, NJ. \nThe Outdoor Art Party is produced by The Art Generators – a collective of artists working together to help each other succeed and make art accessible to everyone.⁠ This event is featured as part of Downtown on Display\, celebrating local businesses with unique events just for you!⁠ Learn more about this event https://theartgenerators.com/events2/sept-20-outdoor-art-party \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
