SUMMARY:Silent Disco
DESCRIPTION:Calling everyone who loves music! Come dance with us at Church Street in Montclair\, for our Silent Disco & stay to mingle afterward!  Your vibe\, your music\, your people. Check out our DJ’s so you know the 2 channels we’ll be vibing out to. We have the headphones\, just bring yourself! Be you\, be loud\, be proud  \nSunday September 20th 3-7pm. Enter via Church Street and & Park Street. See you there! \nLink to Tickets: https://www.tickettailor.com/events/outmontclair/2368395 \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
