SUMMARY:NJ Death Cafe
DESCRIPTION:We invite you to join us for a Death Cafe. A Death Cafe is a welcoming\, facilitated discussion space where people come together to talk openly and honestly about life\, death\, and dying—over tea\, cake\, refreshments\, and meaningful conversation. It’s an opportunity to reflect on\, explore\, and share personal thoughts\, emerging ideas\, and lived experiences. Participants are invited to listen to and engage with others in a safe\, confidential\, and nonjudgmental environment while contemplating mortality. Ultimately\, by talking about death\, we create space to live more fully—with greater intention\, presence\, and purpose. All are welcome! \nContact us at njdeathcafe@gmail.com \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
