SUMMARY:Theater League of Clifton Announces Auditions for “1776”
DESCRIPTION:The Theater League of Clifton will hold auditions for its upcoming production of “1776” on Tuesday\, September 15; Wednesday\, September 16; and Thursday\, September 17\, from 7:00 p.m. to 9:00 p.m. Callbacks by invitation may also be held Thursday\, September 17. \nAuditions will be held at Living Hope\, 303 Maplewood Ave.\, Clifton\, NJ 07013.\nPerformances will be held November 13\, 14 and 15 at the Wayne Community Center\, 1 Pike Drive\, Wayne\, NJ.\nThe production will be directed by Maren Sugarman. \nWith music and lyrics by Sherman Edwards and a book by Peter Stone\, 1776 dramatizes the struggle within the Second Continental Congress to declare American independence. John Adams\, Benjamin Franklin and Thomas Jefferson attempt to persuade a divided Congress to break with England while political\, regional and personal conflicts threaten to derail the effort. \nThose auditioning should prepare 16 to 32 bars of a song and bring sheet music for the accompanist. A bluetooth speaker will be available if needed. Actors will also be asked to read selections from the script. Please bring a résumé and photo. \nFor information on cast and characters\, please visit https://www.theaterleagueofclifton.com/ or email theaterleagueofclifton@gmail.com or call (973)-928-7668 \nFounded in 2005\, the Theater League of Clifton is a nonprofit community organization dedicated to fostering an appreciation of the arts through theatrical performances while providing quality entertainment for all ages. The Theater League of Clifton welcomes volunteers in all aspects of performance and production. \n1776\nMusic and Lyrics by SHERMAN EDWARDS\nBook by PETER STONE\nBased on a concept by SHERMAN EDWARDS\nOriginal Production Directed by PETER HUNT\nOriginally Produced on the Broadway Stage by STUART OSTROW\n1776 is presented through special arrangement with Music Theatre International (MTI). All authorized performance materials are also supplied by MTI. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/theater-league-of-clifton-announces-auditions-for-1776/2026-09-21/
