SUMMARY:Lunch & Learn: AMA with ClearGuide AI
DESCRIPTION:Wondering how AI could actually help your business? Bring us your questions. \nJoin Scott and Andrea Cote\, co-founders of ClearGuide AI\, for an informal\, down-to-earth conversation about AI\, automation\, and what these tools can realistically do for your business. \nNo presentation. No technical background needed. And no sales pitch. \nInstead\, bring your questions or even better\, bring a real challenge from your business. Maybe your team spends hours on repetitive paperwork\, sorting through emails\, entering the same information in multiple places\, following up with customers\, or handling a process you know could be more efficient. \nWe’ll talk through it together and explore where AI or automation could help\, where it might not\, and what practical AI can actually look like inside a business today. \nWhether you’re already experimenting with AI\, completely new to it\, or simply wondering “Could AI make this part of my business easier?”—this conversation is for you. \n📆 Wednesday\, September 23rd\n🕛 12:00–1:00 PM\n📍 RecRoom conference room\n🎟️ Free for all to attend\n🪑 Limited to just 10 people\n🥙 BYO lunch! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
